  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : (200 − 6) ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5\n\nNow, by interchanging the numbers\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 6 and 4\n\n(200 − 6) ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5 ⇒ (200 − 4) ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = 24 ÷ 6 × 25 ÷ 5\n\n**(200 − 4)**__ ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = __**24 ÷ 6**__ × __**25 ÷ 5**__\n\n__**196 ÷ 14**__ × 2 − 8 = __**4 × 5**__\n\n__**14 × 2**__ − 8 = 20\n\n__**28 - 8**__ = 20 \n\n**20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 8 and 2\n\n(200 − 6) ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5 ⇒ (200 − 6) ÷ 14 × 8 − 2 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5\n\n**(200 − 6)**__ ÷ 14 × 8 − 2 = __**24 ÷ 4**__ × __**25 ÷ 5**__\n\n__**194 ÷ 14**__ × 8 − 2 = __**6 × 5**__\n\n__**13.85 × 8**__ − 2 = 30\n\n__**110.8 - 2**__ = 30\n\n108.8 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 24 and 14\n\n(200 − 6) ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5 ⇒ (200 − 6) ÷ 24 × 2 − 8 = 14 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5\n\n**(200 − 6)**__ ÷ 24 × 2 − 8 = __**14 ÷ 4**__ × __**25 ÷ 5**__\n\n__**194 ÷ 24**__ × 2 − 8 = __3.5____** × **____5__\n\n__8.08____** **____**× 2**__ − 8 = 17.5\n\n__**16.16 - 8**__ = 17.5\n\n8.16 ≠ 17.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 6 and 8\n\n(200 − 6) ÷ 14 × 2 − 8 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5 ⇒ (200 − 8) ÷ 14 × 2 − 6 = 24 ÷ 4 × 25 ÷ 5\n\n**(200 − 8)**__ ÷ 14 × 2 − 6 = __**24 ÷ 4**__ × __**25 ÷ 5**__\n\n__**192 **____**÷ 14**__ × 2 − 6 = __6** × **5__\n\n__13.71 ____**× 2**__ − 6 = 30\n\n__**27.42 - 6**__ = 30\n\n21.42 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
